      "conclusion_id": "cancel-then-verify-reclamation",
      "accepted_claim": "At the pinned vLLM revision, finish_requests removes valid requests from scheduling queues, sets terminal status, and calls _free_request. Remote-KV receive state and connector return values can delay _free_blocks. _free_blocks calls _free_request_blocks, which either frees immediately or queues blocks behind a processed-step fence; update_from_output advances that fence before draining deferred frees.",
